    "typed": "Explicit actual TensorDesc and ConstTensorView overloads still pass actual metadata to Graph; they never substitute expected cold metadata.",
    "inventory": "Existing cold ProgramIo input vector holds InputFacts instead of ValueId; ColdProgram removes its parallel vector of Port descriptions.",
    "models": "Qwen hidden/Q/frontier and GLM/DeepSeek/Kimi component inputs use the same facts; recipe descriptors are checked during cold construction.",
    "authority": "Original CompiledGraph/Invocation, leases/pools, Source/Store/Append, Status and actual retirement unchanged. No owner, executor, dynamic callback or hot allocation added."
